 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "RHS・Walters・stauden.de・品種: 花がらを摘むと花期が延び二番花が咲く、晩秋に地際まで刈る。Gaißmayer: 短い走出枝でゆっくり大株になる（はびこる記述ではない）。人が決めた例と同じ",
  "management_type_quote": "deadhead to prolong flowering then cut down to the base in late autumn",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/種] Needs good air circulation (space well and thin out stems as needed) to help combat potential powdery mildew problems.\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 欧米の文献だけの耐暑性：言い回しの照合では 空欄、文を読み直して 中（[MBG・種] prefers climates with mild summers compared to very hot and humid conditions）\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or South-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 2／stauden.de・品種] ausläufertreibend（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] to prevent unwanted self-seeding（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] Remove faded flower panicles to prolong bloom period and to prevent unwanted self-seeding (cultivars generally do not come true from seed).\n[地下茎 2／stauden.de・品種] ausläufertreibend\n[地下茎の食い違い] Gaißmayer は 1 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち、ランナー）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[ユーザーの決定 2026-11-24] 地下茎 2（根茎・ランナーで広がる記述）なので 強い",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[NC State・品種] Habit/Form: Clumping; Erect; Mounding",
